# Force LF in the working tree on every platform.
#
# With core.autocrlf=true a checkout rewrites every file as CRLF, which
# prettier's default endOfLine: "lf" then rejects, so `git checkout` leaves the
# tree failing `format` and `git status` reporting modifications with no diff.
# The blobs are already LF, so this only fixes how files are written out.
* text=auto eol=lf